msgid ""
"Morakot Flight Controller — **NDAA-Compliant. Made in Taiwan.** Built for "
"Performance. Engineered, tested, and manufactured in Taiwan, the Morakot "
"Flight Controller meets full NDAA compliance, ensuring trusted quality and "
"security for professional applications. With an integrated Ethernet "
"interface, it delivers high-speed, reliable connectivity for next-generation"
" FPV and unmanned aerial systems."
msgstr ""
"Morakot 飞控——**符合 NDAA。台湾制造。** 为性能而生。Morakot 飞控在台湾设计、测试和制造，完全满足 NDAA "
"合规要求，为专业应用提供可信赖的品质与安全。凭借集成的以太网接口，它为下一代 FPV 和无人系统提供高速、可靠的连接。"

