msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the “XXX_bl.bin” firmware, "
"using your favorite DFU loading tool. Once the initial firmware is loaded "
"you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. "
"Updates should be done with the “\\*.apj” firmware files."
msgstr ""
"初次加载固件可通过 DFU 完成：按住 bootloader 按钮的同时插入 USB，然后使用你喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载 “XXX_bl.bin” "
"固件。初次固件加载完成后，即可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 “\\*.apj” 固件文件。"
